      "comment": "Naberius: Rhinedottir (host)",
      "content": "After the Cataclysm, Rhinedottir devoured Naberius' heart and became the Ruler of Life in practice, wielding her authority and attending the Rulers' meetings. Naberius' consciousness remains. She voices objections that Rhinedottir calls \"nagging\" and often ignores, once pretending \"the signal seems to be quite poor\"; at other times Naberius talks her round.",
