    "1": {
      "uid": 1,
      "key": [
        "Four Shades",
        "Four Great Rulers",
        "Shade of Time",
        "Shade of Death"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Naberius: The Four Shades",
      "content": "Naberius (Life), Ronova (Death), Istaroth (Time), and Asmoday (Space) were created by the Heavenly Principles to govern the laws of the world. They are older than the Archons and reside in Celestia. Asmoday has been missing since the Cataclysm.",
