    "2": {
      "uid": 2,
      "key": [
        "Authority of Life",
        "Koitar",
        "Snowland Fae",
        "Vila"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Naberius: Authority of Life and Koitar",
      "content": "During the angels' rebellion Koitar stole a portion of Naberius' Authority of Life and gave it to the artisans of Hyperborea, who forged the Snowland Fae on the bones of the Cryo Dragon. The share later went to the Vila, and Vesna inherited it through the blood of the first Vila. In 7.1 Rhinedottir, as Ruler of Life, reclaimed it from Vesna at the Northland Bank, calling its use to extract life or defy death a grave transgression.",
