    "3": {
      "uid": 3,
      "key": [
        "Egeria",
        "Hydro Dragon",
        "heart of the Primordial Sea"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Naberius: Egeria and the Primordial Sea",
      "content": "When the Hydro Dragon was removed as the heart of the Primordial Sea, the envoy of Celestia charged with creating life made Egeria, a heart with the nobility of a dragon and the majesty of a god, but no divine duty. The hymn to Maadteraahka, Mother of Life, credits her with birthing that heart, which identifies the envoy with Naberius.",
