    "5": {
      "uid": 5,
      "key": [
        "Nahida",
        "Irminsul",
        "Pyro Gnosis"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [
        "Naberius",
        "Ruler of Life"
      ],
      "comment": "Naberius: Nahida and the Burning of Irminsul",
      "content": "When Nahida used the Pyro Gnosis to burn Irminsul, she faced the Rulers of Death, Time and Life in her mind. Ronova and Istaroth questioned her choice. Naberius observed that Nahida had become a great tree herself, so the loss of another need not be feared, and bade her farewell as \"Lord of Dendro\".",
